Package: libiio-csharp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${cli:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libiio0
Description: C# bindings for libiio
 CLI (Mono/.NET) bindings for the libiio library for interfacing with
 Linux IIO devices.
 .
 This package contains the libiio-sharp assembly. libiio0 provides the
 native shared library loaded at runtime via the bundled dllmap config.
